    "title": "Angi: Hire Home Service Pros",
    "description": "Home renovation or repair \u2013 Angi makes dream homes a reality. Find a service pro for all your home improvement needs with easy booking. Download for free today to connect with a professional near you and book all the home services you need \u2013 from roofing to housekeeping, Angi has it all!\r\n\r\nAngi is the home service planner perfect for any home project. Lawn care, landscaping, and everything in between \u2013 discover the ideal service pro for your home remodel plans. Get a top local professional to get the job done. Simply pick from our list of home services, select a time that works for you, and you\u2019re set.\r\n\r\nPlan your project with an Angi Certified service pro and get a professional for all your home service needs. House cleaning or complete home renovation \u2013 whatever it is Angi has you covered. Roofing, plumbing, landscaping, and more \u2013 Angi was made to bring you all the home services you need. Home repair or dream home remodel, Angi has a professional to cover all home projects.\r\n\r\nChoose an Angi Certified service pro ready to tackle any home project. Home services from top notch professionals are just a few taps away. Search and hire contractors near you with ratings and reviews, and home project quotes. Whether it\u2019s housekeeping or full on home remodel, hire a professional confidently with ratings provided by actual homeowners using Angi.\r\n\r\nGet service pro estimates, expert guides, and home service planner features instantly. Hire a professional to take on your next home remodel, repair and maintenance project. Angi is the ultimate home renovation planning app for all home projects. Enjoy financing options and bring your dream home to life affordably. Reach your home service goals with project tools made for you on Angi today.\r\n\r\nAngi Features:\r\n\r\nHOME SERVICES WITH HIGHLY RATED PROFESSIONALS\r\n- Find a home service pro or contractor in your area for any project\r\n- Search for the next professional with Angi\u2019s home project planner tools\r\n- Hire contractors confidently with reviews from other users\r\n\r\nHOME SERVICE PLANNER\r\n- Browse over 500 home improvement categories in an easy-to-use service planner\r\n- Hire a professional and track activity easily\r\n- See home repair, home remodel, and overall project costs and estimates in your area\r\n\r\nFLEXIBLE BOOKING & PAYMENT OPTIONS\r\n- Book a local professional for home services in just a few taps\r\n- Pay your service pro conveniently in the Angi app\r\n- Flexible payment options with pay-over-time financing\r\n\r\nHOME SERVICES & MORE\r\nFind and hire a professional for all home service projects, including:\r\n- Home Renovation, Remodeling & Additions\r\n- Home Repair\r\n- House Cleaning & Maid Services\r\n- Kitchen & Bathroom Remodels\r\n- Roofing\r\n- Windows\r\n- Concrete Experts\r\n- Painting\r\n- Heating & Furnace Systems\r\n- Electricians\r\n- Decks\r\n- Pest Control\r\n- Foundations\r\n- Plumbing professional\r\n- Lawn care & maintenance\r\n- Landscaping\r\n- Siding\r\n- Fences\r\n\r\nGet 20% savings on 150+ home renovation projects year-round as well as exclusive access to special offers and benefits when you join Angi Key. See here for more details: https://www.angi.com/articles/angi-key.htm\r\n\r\nHome remodel and improvement is easy with Angi. Hire a top professional to repair and renovate your dream home. Download now and get your next home project done seamlessly.\r\n\r\nCalifornia Privacy:\r\nhttps://vault.pactsafe.io/s/a84ad12b-7245-4a12-9fc5-2011a3bf4d62/legal.html#contract-hyia9fa6b\r\n\r\nPayment options through Affirm are subject to eligibility and are provided by these lending partners: affirm.com/lenders. Affirm and its lending partners do business in accordance with federal Fair Lending laws.",
